21: /// Handle keyboard input for special cases not covered by keymap
22: ///
23: /// Called as a fallback when:
24: /// - A modal is active (all input routes to modal)
25: /// - CSV cell editing is active (all input routes to cell editor)
26: /// - Option double-tap multi-cursor gesture is in progress
27: /// - Keymap returns NoMatch or a non-simple command
